## 核心设计模式

### 1. 工厂模式 (Factory Pattern)

```typescript
// 创建API实例的工厂函数
export function createAgentsApi(client: ApiClient): AgentsApi {
  return new AgentsApi(client);
}

export function createThreadsApi(client: ApiClient): ThreadsApi {
  return new ThreadsApi(client);
}
```

### 2. 单例模式 + Proxy (Singleton + Proxy)

```typescript
// 全局API实例 - 使用Proxy实现惰性初始化
export const api = new Proxy({} as Api, {
  get(target, prop) {
    const client = getApiClient();
    if (!target[prop]) {
      Object.defineProperty(target, prop, {
        value: new Api(client)[prop],
        writable: false,
      });
    }
    return target[prop];
  },
}) as Api;
```

**优势**：
- 延迟加载：只有首次访问时才创建实例
- 性能优化：避免不必要的初始化
- 类型安全：完整的TypeScript支持

### 3. 仓储模式 (Repository Pattern)

```typescript
export class Api {
  public readonly auth: AuthApi;
  public readonly agents: AgentsApi;
  public readonly threads: ThreadsApi;
  public readonly tools: ToolsApi;
  public readonly files: FilesApi;
  public readonly config: ConfigApi;
}
```

**特点**：
- 统一的数据访问入口
- 隐藏底层实现细节
- 易于测试和mock

### 4. Provider模式

```typescript
export function AppProviders({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  const [queryClient] = useState(() => new QueryClient({...}));

  return (
    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>
      <ThemeProvider>
        {children}
      </ThemeProvider>
      <ReactQueryDevtools />
    </QueryClientProvider>
  );
}
```

### 5. 自定义Hooks模式

将业务逻辑封装为可复用的hooks：

```typescript
export const useAgents = (params, options) => {
  // 智能缓存策略
  const normalizedParams = useMemo(() => {...}, [params]);
  const placeholderData = useMemo(() => {...}, [queryClient, normalizedParams]);

  return useQuery({
    queryKey: agentKeys.list(normalizedParams),
    queryFn: () => getAgents(normalizedParams),
    placeholderData, // 使用缓存数据
    ...customOptions,
  });
};
```

### 6. 乐观更新模式 (Optimistic Update)

```typescript
export const useDeleteAgent = () => {
  return useMutation({
    onMutate: async (agentId) => {
      // 取消进行中的查询
      await queryClient.cancelQueries({ queryKey: agentKeys.lists() });

      // 保存之前的状态
      const previousAgents = queryClient.getQueriesData({ queryKey: agentKeys.lists() });

      // 乐观更新
      queryClient.setQueriesData({ queryKey: agentKeys.lists() }, (old) => ({
        ...old,
        agents: old.agents.filter(agent => agent.agent_id !== agentId),
      }));

      return { previousAgents };
    },
    onError: (err, agentId, context) => {
      // 失败时回滚
      if (context?.previousAgents) {
        context.previousAgents.forEach(([queryKey, data]) => {
          queryClient.setQueryData(queryKey, data);
        });
      }
    },
  });
};
```

